{"parentUuid":"3c0a9bd2-40ca-45ed-aead-aecec217c55d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgnyEBVBXnPLx3SsdsL2w","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01HwqSWmPmxndvVv3eiCocVj","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies; cat > handoffs/viktortrilar.md <<'EOF'\n# viktortrilar: viktor/copilot-llm\n**Goal:** local Qwen words the copilot's answers, on checked facts, with the template as the fallback\n**Done:** app/copilot/llm.py fetches facts in code, then checks the model's citations, IDs, numbers and safety. Set `COPILOT_MODEL` to turn it on. scripts/eval_copilot.py runs 20 questions. PR #10 is merged: main has Valmet's scene, routes, and copilot panel\n**Verified:** lint passes; 157 tests pass, 2 skipped, using a fake model. Real model not yet measured: job 2927176 running, 4B and 9B, answers in `sinceai/runs/llm`\n**Next:** read the saved answers, not only the counts. Pick a model or keep the template. pyproject needs transformers 5+ and a way to fetch weights, in their own small PR. Then rehearse on the 5090 and a tablet, offline\n**Blockers:** none. P-005 on obj-0049 is an unconfirmed pick, confidence 0.3. Cert valid to 2026-11-07 20:41\nEOF\ngit add handoffs/viktortrilar.md app/copilot/llm.py app/api/copilot_link.py app/api/main.py web/copilot.js scripts/eval_copilot.py tests/test_copilot_llm.py; git commit -qm \"Let a local model word copilot answers, with code checking every fact\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\"; git log --oneline -1 | cut -c1-80; git status --short | head -3","description":"Update the handoff and commit the work"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":148,"cache_read_input_tokens":473946,"output_tokens":666,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_req