he fouling signature.', 'Data quality issues like timestamp jitter could affect the accuracy of these recent trend measurements.']\n C: ['ASSET-017', 'DOC-FIELD-SAFETY']\n\nQ: Why would falling flow point to fouling here? [3.8s]\n A: The system records show process flow percentage decreasing over 20 samples while efficiency loss is noted. Follow site lockout/tagout procedures and permits (DOC-FIELD-SAFETY).\n H: ['Falling flow indicates fouling because the asset summary explicitly links efficiency loss to a fouling-like signature.', 'Falling flow indicates fouling because historical cases for this asset class interpret similar efficiency loss as fouling.']\n C: ['ASSET-017', 'EVT-00962', 'EVT-00959', 'CASE-025', 'CASE-044', 'DOC-FIELD-SAFETY']\n20 None {'process_pressure_bar': (4.509, 4.468, 4.927, 'decreasing', 20), 'process_flow_pct': (64.557, 63.347, 83.191, 'decreasing', 20)}\n100 None {'process_pressure_bar': (4.509, 4.217, 5.003, 'stable', 100), 'process_flow_pct': (64.557, 55.473, 85.235, 'decreasing', 100)}\n10000 None {'process_pressure_bar': (4.509, 4.217, 5.003, 'increasing', 144), 'process_flow_pct': (64.557, 55.473, 90.544, 'decreasing', 144)}\n144 2026-10-05T00:00:00 2026-10-07T23:30:00 [(('process_flow_pct', 'process_pressure_bar'), 144)]\nTelemetryPoint(timestamp='2026-10-07T22:30:00', asset_id='ASSET-017', tag='P-005', asset_class='PROCESS_PUMP', area_id='AREA-03', metrics={'process_pressure_bar': 4.601, 'process_flow_pct': 68.815})\nM-005 ASSET-023\nMOT-005 None\nMTR-005 None\n['CV-001', 'CV-002', 'CV-003', 'CV-004', 'CV-005', 'CV-006', 'CV-007', 'CV-008', 'CV-009', 'CV-010', 'CV-011', 'CV-012', 'M-001', 'M-002', 'M-003', 'M-004', 'M-005', 'M-006', 'P-001', 'P-002', 'P-003', 'P-004', 'P-005', 'P-006', 'PT-001', 'PT-002', 'PT-003', '\n435:    def get_telemetry(self, id_or_tag: str, limit: int = 50) -> list[TelemetryPoint]:\n436-        \"\"\"Get recent telemetry points for an asset.\"\"\"\n437-        aid = self.resolve_asset_id(id_or_tag)\n438-    